atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422850/extras/970c455c5b2e62ee7ad8455729bc7b39.mp4?t=1735337197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Level up system and status update mechanism.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422850/extras/ef0a070f20e3602f00fd84a7c6a210e9.poster.avif?t=1735337197\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422850/extras/ef0a070f20e3602f00fd84a7c6a210e9.webm?t=1735337197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422850/extras/ef0a070f20e3602f00fd84a7c6a210e9.mp4?t=1735337197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>With an exciting mix of platforming and combat<br>Your swordsmanship will be put to the test as you face fearsome enemies in intense battles.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422850/extras/6bca306f39a239bf338fe47d74f40326.poster.avif?t=1735337197\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422850/extras/6bca306f39a239bf338fe47d74f40326.webm?t=1735337197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422850/extras/6bca306f39a239bf338fe47d74f40326.mp4?t=1735337197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Get ready to enter a world full of dangers and challenges, discover the secrets that await you in 'The Unknown'. Venture into this extraordinary journey and discover Uriel's destiny!.</strong>",
